--------------------------------------------------

Handle safely when:

- Goal was already archived/deleted.
- Goal no longer exists.
- Accountable user changed before the request completed.
- User session is invalid/expired.
- API request fails.
- User clicks Archive/Delete more than once.

Return appropriate responses and avoid duplicate operations.

